o Chavez Show- (20.2.2026)Obama's War / A Death in Tehran- (21.2.2026)Digital Nation / The Dancing Boys of Afghanistan / The Wounded Platoon- (22.2.2026)Battle for Haiti / An Optimist in Haiti / The Man Behind the Mosque / A Perfect Terrorist- (24.2.2026)Taliban Country / For Sama / Crisis in Venezuela- (4.3.2026)Who Killed the Nuns? / The Interrogator- (18.7.2026)The Crown Prince & the President-\"And they kept coming, they kept coming, they kept coming, they kept coming. And then there were more people than bullets.\"(21.05.2020)méněvíce","stars":4},{"author":"quip","text":"Digital Nation (2010) ***** Částečně navazuje na předchozí film (Growing Up Online ***, 2007), logicky je daleko aktuálnější. Režisérka navíc dává větší prostor oběma stranám (Douglas Rushkoff v tomhle směru posloužil výborně) a film je opravdu dokumentem, ne jen kupou názorů či dokonce honem na čarodějnice (který předchozí film občas připomínal). Zajímavých myšlenek je ve filmu několik, nejvíc ale zaujala tahle: \"It's not that the students are dumb, it's not that they're not trying. I think they're trying in a way that is not as effective as it could be - because they're distracted by everything else.\" - David Jones, Associate professor, MIT. Nevím, jak vy, ale já fucking am distracted by everything else. Watch here:http://www.pbs.org/wgbh/pages/frontline/digitalnation/view/(30.04.2010)","stars":4},{"author":"Kerbello","text":"Viděno: China undercover ***, In the Age of AI ***.(21.11.2020)","stars":null}],"vods":[{"platform":"Apple TV","url":"https://srv.clickfuse.com/ads/adclkr.php?id=100006636&url=https%3A//tv.apple.com/cz/movie/the-interrupters/umc.cmc.1vgxv0pixp2e6mrbbpihsqep4"},{"platform":"KVIFF.TV","url":"https://kviff.tv/screens/home?video=pro-samu"}],"link":"https://www.csfd.cz/film/261276-frontline/prehled/","csfd_id":261276,"root_id":261276,"root_title_id":null,"root_title":null,"root_slug":null,"is_toplevel":true,"season_no":null,"episode_no":null,"season_count":44,"episode_count